# Root build context hygiene. Only the bootstrap image builds from the
# repository root; everything else builds from apps/<service>.
#
# Without this, the context includes apps/web/node_modules (hundreds of MB) and
# the Elixir _build tree, which makes every upload slow.

.git
.github
images
docs

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/_build
**/deps
**/cover

**/*.exe
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/coverage.out
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
